  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "ba9cd4697414d2d5d43e43aa202857d08ea7dfc57dc8da957b4f5d96a58d9495",
      "target_id": "XML:2703229",
      "text": "2. 一般专业机构的禁止行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "6a3224f72b95fbbf8a2ee19d73c6034152973b19d7bf9ee447474c4a2dc36b0d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703230",
      "text": "甲. 为收集与传输请求目的无关的个人信息，违反本法第十六条第一款而要求传输该信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "e787254363947bb3fa223ca04469b1946f5e628fd0c406486eb19baeaf8e2809",
      "target_id": "XML:2703232",
      "text": "乙. 并非为本法第十六条第三款规定的服务运营所必需，却在"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "58b125702b286e9a6f199c30e5cb393920401bcade8c8988c162cef6610e1132",
      "target_id": "XML:2703233",
      "text": "提出传输请求的同时取得将已接收信息提供给第三方的同意的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "db0590d2ad4228913e75cb11871396e88be99a9e9adc25dd9257262eee0549b2",
      "target_id": "XML:2703234",
      "text": "丙. 违反本法第二十一条，在传输请求目的达成后仍保存已接收个人信息的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "21041a6699727d6d5cfec822f0e9e8267b59f13f382188d665079ad1033b44ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703235",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00029",
      "source_hash": "b8a7fc0aad68f5099a7a4070f4a6e4fa100e68af0f70bab3e155cc75a1226164",
      "target_id": "XML:2703236",
      "text": "丁. 强迫或不正当地诱导代理行使本法第三十八条第一款规定的权利的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00030",
      "source_hash": "d38d082a6259a5280a5433ee8d387c74204c96ce32276a2a51596738e3b69a74",
      "target_id": "XML:2703237",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "8690a5bb06e265675ff90799aded2abf94c7404ee0f882680226fff2759fbaaa",
      "target_id": "XML:2703238",
      "text": "戊. 未经信息主体同意而变更第四十二条之五第三款规定的传输请求内容，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "42599632012f9ae6dc7cd3fcc044a582abb87248b9e72226f5a8bc122040bf1e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703239",
      "text": "据此请求个人信息的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "6a650a123b326a49acca6bee41df76e444849b99fe58a33d795c4e235c0f9a9e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703240",
      "text": "己. 尽管信息主体依照第四十二条之五第六款提出要求，仍不立即变更或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "b1c90f868adc95f948701db7f3cb990a6bbba3bc179425b33c0747fcc0e954e3",
      "target_id": "XML:2703241",
      "text": "撤回传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "2bd9069b885317b2acfd164a5c1ab729ae9edd4abe24766ff599200c144badea",
      "target_id": "XML:2703242",
      "text": "庚. 因信息主体依照第四十二条之五第六款变更或撤回传输请求，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "90d5a0db690a3e82a4e833c87e4795d03fcfef56a18532629064377d7215838e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703243",
      "text": "无正当理由要求违约金等经济代价的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "defce97f86ce63319ed37c6eac4cba7d5d8aa86ff52e1aa2e151456c67697853",
      "target_id": "XML:2703244",
      "text": "辛. 规避支付第四十七条第四款规定的个人信息传输手续费的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "2c39da6117ec0b1eb608ff741970231ac37fa1972f261703b933e3f7a61f0af5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703245",
      "text": "壬. 强迫或不正当地诱导提出传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "508a2691e66c20280cd42e7dd07cf6a5d481399a06c13fff8e8b1ae805a381a8",
      "target_id": "XML:2703246",
      "text": "癸. 强迫或诱导信息主体不向自身以外的第三方提出传输请求，或强迫撤回对第三方传输请求的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "4e3b8801669690a9f449aba5b89afea04d2e29ed1f4c523f3427e893e58a5624",
      "target_id": "XML:2703248",
      "text": "子. 为自身利益，向信息主体推荐或劝诱订立被认定不适合该信息主体的合同的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "9be8aaaeb3c2ca50afb93f7a7ee45e297f77956fa3f601e6973647db15fbdbf1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703249",
      "text": "行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "bf1374e988c849cf3afda16af13247d1385c20df0fffbaf7275ec45d38e335a1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703250",
      "text": "丑. 为自身或第三方利益而侵害特定信息主体利益的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "ba17893a7e872f4af6dcdbeeb10db63776eb08bc8850758ca17537df3db2cc91",
      "target_id": "XML:2703251",
      "text": "寅. 以信息主体提出传输请求为由，持续、反复访问个人信息处理者的计算机设施，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00044",
      "source_hash": "6a6786a3c481cc43eb048961aa064ae21a377897a9ff342c141c0d76200552f0",
      "target_id": "XML:2703252",
      "text": "造成故障的行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "8a3d9efdde4e131988a6a1836c3024c8a5544c36b770718b8c114ac9955214cd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703253",
      "text": "卯. 其他与甲目至寅目类似，可能侵害信息主体利益或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "5d6b77d1a709b1cf567b6d024da7689c2e67a023628e86095ab2fd8273f6b629",
      "target_id": "XML:2703254",
      "text": "妨碍传输体系建立，并由保护委员会规定及公告的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37054-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "28c806c91546e8c2f5e6842bc4d1fcdba0b2464d2cb94668fab83bf6a0e6f7ec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703255",
      "text": "行为"
    }
  ],
  "note": "A37054 general-specialist prohibitions rows 23-47 checked against Korean, corrected 14 subitem labels and references, forced requests, transfers, fees, unfair contracts, repeated system access. Family incomplete."
}
